<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups Allied Domecq.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman ups Allied Domecq.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Domecq Plc was raised to &quot;trading buy&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, market sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was up 7p at 465-1/2 by 1417 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
